WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
All four species belong in the mitzvah,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.580
with the correct arrangement and orientation.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.600
Practise the sequence beforehand, rehearsal helps, but

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.620
never replaces the complete required act.
